{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119830/extras/Co-op.png?t=1750648103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MISERY</strong> is a brutal online co-op survival horror simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and up to 5 friends are survivors of a nuclear disaster. The old world is gone. Your underground bunker is the last refuge, and you won\u2019t last long without food and resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every day is a struggle to stay alive. Go alone or squad up with friends and search for supplies in procedurally generated locations: abandoned military objects, radioactive swamps, rotting villages, and ruined towns. Fight terrifying monsters, face the unknown, and try to survive one more night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat powerful bosses and recover antenna parts to send a salvation signal and prepare for the final evacuation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119830/extras/Craft.png?t=1750648103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use what you find to craft weapons, gear, and tools, everything from nail bats and gas masks to rifles, armor, and explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow crops back at your base (hint: human ash makes good fertilizer). Hunt, cook \u201cmeals,\u201d purify water, and mix medicine from expired pills. Everything you make just buys a little more time for you, or for someone you still care about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119830/extras/Upgrade_Bunker.png?t=1750648103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your bunker room by room. Set up gas, solar, or gnome-powered generators and wire electricity to lights, filters, and workbenches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Furnish it with whatever loot you drag home: a table, a drawer, a cracked sofa, maybe even a nice carpet. The old owners won\u2019t miss them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119830/extras/radiation.png?t=1750648103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some zones are radioactive and unstable, pulsing with strange energy. You might find powerful artifacts out there\u2026 but they mess with your head. The longer you stay, the harder it is to tell what\u2019s real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go out during the day. Come back before nightfall. The zone plays tricks on your mind. You\u2019ll hear things. See things. Feel something watching. And if your grip slips, the bunker won\u2019t save you. Nothing will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119830/extras/Do_not_Go_Alone.png?t=1750648103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nothing feels better than sharing the adventure. Looting bandos together. Watching each other\u2019s backs. Sitting around a fire, drinking whatever you found, and exhaling smoke into the cold rain. For a moment, you might even feel alive again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2119830?t=1750648103","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119830/eb28afbba19e44691d0e4bdd87ca2e9cea73a129/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750648103","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119830/4c4ba281e6de829c0cbc30b08b125ad980444b10/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750648103","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119830/4c4ba281e6de829c0cbc30b08b125ad980444b10/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750648103","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119830/extras/Co-op.png?t=1750648103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MISERY</strong> is a brutal online co-op survival horror simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and up to 5 friends are survivors of a nuclear disaster. The old world is gone. Your underground bunker is the last refuge, and you won\u2019t last long without food and resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every day is a struggle to stay alive. Go alone or squad up with friends and search for supplies in procedurally generated locations: abandoned military objects, radioactive swamps, rotting villages, and ruined towns. Fight terrifying monsters, face the unknown, and try to survive one more night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat powerful bosses and recover antenna parts to send a salvation signal and prepare for the final evacuation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119830/extras/Craft.png?t=1750648103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use what you find to craft weapons, gear, and tools, everything from nail bats and gas masks to rifles, armor, and explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow crops back at your base (hint: human ash makes good fertilizer). Hunt, cook \u201cmeals,\u201d purify water, and mix medicine from expired pills. Everything you make just buys a little more time for you, or for someone you still care about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119830/extras/Upgrade_Bunker.png?t=1750648103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your bunker room by room. Set up gas, solar, or gnome-powered generators and wire electricity to lights, filters, and workbenches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Furnish it with whatever loot you drag home: a table, a drawer, a cracked sofa, maybe even a nice carpet. The old owners won\u2019t miss them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119830/extras/radiation.png?t=1750648103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some zones are radioactive and unstable, pulsing with strange energy. You might find powerful artifacts out there\u2026 but they mess with your head. The longer you stay, the harder it is to tell what\u2019s real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go out during the day. Come back before nightfall. The zone plays tricks on your mind. You\u2019ll hear things. See things. Feel something watching. And if your grip slips, the bunker won\u2019t save you. Nothing will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119830/extras/Do_not_Go_Alone.png?t=1750648103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nothing feels better than sharing the adventure. Looting bandos together. Watching each other\u2019s backs. Sitting around a fire, drinking whatever you found, and exhaling smoke into the cold rain. For a moment, you might even feel alive again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Platypus Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119830/8e3564da094703b14d79d0e533cf237346c719c7/header.jpg?t=1750648103","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"MISERY uses the Unreal Engine 5. Unreal is a trademark or registered trademark of Epic Games, Inc. in the United States of America and elsewhere. Unreal Engine, Copyright 1998 - 2025, Epic Games, Inc. All rights reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257150070,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150070/movie480.mp4?t=1750648101","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150070/movie_max.mp4?t=1750648101"},"name":"Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257150070/363eeda09c2e02a95752df98368b67b269163df1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750648101","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150070/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750648101","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150070/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750648101"}},{"highlight":false,"id":257132361,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132361/movie480.mp4?t=1745875871","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25713